git Edge label

branch main

step Commit
  say Add A and B on main.
  commit A on main
  commit B on main

step Above
  say The text after the colon is the label. Without side it sits above the tags.
  HEAD -> A: detach

step Below
  say side picks where the label sits: above, below, left or right.
  HEAD -> B: go back [side: below]
